Confluent 8.2.1 Version
======================

1. Start the internal Prometheus engine
./prometheus-start

2. Route Alertmanager cleanly to port 9098
export ALERTMANAGER_PORT=9098
./alertmanager-start

3. Start the confluent platform
./confluent local services start

4. prometheus console
http://localhost:9090

5. Confluent control center 
http://localhost:9021
